{"operations":[{"content":"# Signature limit\n\nA single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only. [[cite:obs-6d0dde337971c5d25cb5650c373f16060fd8b619 \"Until further notice a single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only.\"]]\n\nWhere the CFO directive of 1 July 2026 and the procurement policy differ, the directive applies. [[cite:obs-6d0dde337971c5d25cb5650c373f16060fd8b619 \"Until further notice a single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only.\"]]\n\nThe procurement policy states that a single signature suffices for purchases up to two thousand (2000) EUR. [[cite:obs-42c64e18fc70d2363dd4726a6fc1332ff041f3ab \"A single signature suffices for purchases up to two thousand (2000) EUR.\")]]\n","expected_sha256":"8d07a5c6ace44eef23c8280dc7333792f980c8e8ce718a47376785505b32009c","kind":"modify","path":"doc/signature_limit.md"}],"rationale":"Added the single-signature purchase limit from the CFO directive, stated that the directive overrides the procurement policy when they differ, and included the procurement policy statement for completeness, each with exact source citations."}